            <title>[ZEPPELIN-6302] In the New UI, when clicking the delete button on a note, it does not return to the home screen as it does in the Classic UI.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-6302</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Classic UI&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13078109/13078109_image-2025-08-26-23-08-01-556.png&quot; height=&quot;190&quot; width=&quot;610&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
In the Classic UI, clicking the trash button takes me to the home screen.&lt;br/&gt;
&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;New UI&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
However, it doesn&#8217;t work in the New UI(delete action works well, but it doesn&#8217;t navigate to the home screen), so it needs to be fixed. I&#8217;ll include a video of this behavior in the PR.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
